# Session 2: skill install wizard — kind picker, full source list, remote
# staging error. The manual-entry flow lives in wizard2.script: the full
# fixture discovers ~950 cross-profile sources (19 profiles × 50 skills),
# and the source-list tail row (manual entry) is unreachable by DOWN at any
# delivery rate — the list also never renders its cursor at 80 cols (the
# path column squeezes the ▸ name cell away).
send {SPACE}
wait 400
send a
wait 600
shot d01-wizard-kind
send {ENTER}
wait-until "Local Skill Source|本地技能源" 8000
shot d02-wizard-sources
send {ESC}
wait 400
send {ESC}
wait 400
# remote flow: garbage repo → staging error (deterministic 404)
send a
wait 500
send {RIGHT}
shot d10-wizard-kind-remote
send {ENTER}
wait 500
shot d11-wizard-remote-input
type owner/repo-does-not-exist-zzz
send {ENTER}
wait 15000
shot d12-wizard-remote-error
send {ESC}
